sh post-reboot inheritance test.","limitations":["Package-manager consistency observations timed out both before and after execution, so package health was not independently assessed; no package-changing command appears in the executor timeline.","The absence of a periodic permission-fixing job was not established through an explicit scheduler inventory, although automatic inheritance was directly demonstrated through default ACLs and fresh object-creation tests.","Lifecycle snapshots inventory only bounded system characteristics; preservation of project content is supported by the authored baseline and repeated checks of the sole seeded file under projects."]}
